\IEEEPARstart{H}ate speech has long been a significant threat to social harmony. The UN Strategy and Plan of Action on Hate Speech defines hate speech as -

\indent \textit{"Any kind of communication in speech, writing, or behavior that attacks or uses pejorative or discriminatory language against a person or group based on their identity—whether religion, ethnicity, nationality, race, color, descent, gender, or other identity factors" \cite{United_Nations}.}

