\section{Limitations}
Due to resource limitations, our experiments are currently restricted to the Qwen-2.5-VL-3B model. In future work, we plan to extend our analysis to larger models and other multimodal large language models to assess the generality of our findings. Additionally, this study currently focuses only on the $3\times3$ jigsaw puzzle task. Investigating forgetting behaviors across a broader range of multimodal tasks is an important direction we aim to explore next.

