    \item \textbf{Hit Ratio (HR)}~\cite{10.1145/3269206.3271776}: 
    We consider the hit rate as the frequency of items in the recommendation list that meet the user's needs. The hit rate reflects the extent to which specific recommended items are accepted by users.
    % : 
    % \begin{equation}
