    \item \textbf{NDCG}~\cite{10572486}: 
    We adopt Normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain (NDCG) to evaluate the ranking quality of the recommendation results. Items that are relevant and ranked higher are given more weight. NDCG reflects the quality of the recommendation list.
